WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.367
-You ever see a photo
in the news

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.601
and think that headlines
should be different?

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:04.767
Well, we're gonna take care
of that right now.

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:05.968
It's time for
"News and Improved."

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.100
Here we go.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.968
-♪ News and Improved ♪

00:00:12.968 --> 00:00:15.334
-For example,
check out this first photo.

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:18.100
The original headline was,
"Dr. Fauci says U.S.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.267
is out of pandemic phase."

00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:21.601
Yep.
The headline can definitely

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.300
be improved because if you only
looked at the photo,

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:25.868
the headline could have been,
"Dad does mic drop

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:27.133
after destroying eulogy."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:31.133
He's like...
[ Applause ]

00:00:31.133 --> 00:00:32.701
-Come on!

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:34.367
-Up next, this headline says,

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.734
"Queen Elizabeth beams
at Royal Windsor Horse Show."

00:00:37.734 --> 00:00:40.100
The headline could've been,
"Wedding guest gets really into

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.067
'Little bit softer now'
portion of 'Shout.'"

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.334
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:46.200
♪♪

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.434
-♪ Oh, oh, way-oh ♪

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:51.567
-This next headline was,

00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:54.534
"Biden's job approval numbers
continue to slide."

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.534
Headline could've been,
"Father of the bride

00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:58.300
clearly taking a leak
in the shrubs."

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:00.534 --> 00:01:04.901
-"Ooh!"
-"Oh!"

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:09.300
Next headline was, "BTS holds
White House press briefing."

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.567
Headline could've been,
"New FDA commissioners

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:15.467
announce plans to make butter
35% smoother by 2024."

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:20.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.801
The next headline was,
"Harris announces plan

00:01:22.801 --> 00:01:24.701
to cancel
federal student loans."

00:01:24.701 --> 00:01:26.701
Headline could've been,
"Mom accidentally walks in

00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:28.501
on son's
'personal computer time.'"

00:01:28.501 --> 00:01:30.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:33.901
"Mom!
It's my personal --

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:35.701
it's my personal computer time."
-Throuple.

00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:37.467
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.467 --> 00:01:38.801
Next headline was,

00:01:38.801 --> 00:01:41.100
"Prime Minister Trudeau
attends ceremony."

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:42.267
Headline could've been,

00:01:42.267 --> 00:01:44.434
"Dad gets just a little high
for PTA meeting."

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:51.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.067
And finally, this headline was,

00:01:53.067 --> 00:01:55.367
"Pope Francis
opens doors for women."

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:57.367
Headline could've been,
"Drunk friend gives final,

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:00.300
reassuring look before eating it
on water skis."

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:01.801
That's all the time we have
for "News and Improved."

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:02.968
We have a great show.

